#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusf7.rst:59 7b5958a98164462da43721791306a653
msgid ""
"The shared UART3/I2C pins are enabled by default only for I2C operation to "
"allow external compass or digital airspeed sensor attachment.If at least one"
" device attached externally does not have pull-up resistors, then 2K ohm "
"pull-up resistors will need to be added externally to these pins."
msgstr ""
"共用的 UART3/I2C 引脚默认仅启用 I2C "
"操作，以允许连接外置罗盘或数字空速传感器。如果外接的至少一个设备没有上拉电阻，则需要在这些引脚上外部添加 2K 欧姆上拉电阻。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusf7.rst:61 0f1dbaf2e6714b61aba038ca3bd757c3
msgid ""
"By setting :ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` to 2, those pins change "
"from I2C to UART3 TX and RX pins."
msgstr ""
"通过将 :ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` 设置为 2，这些引脚将从 I2C 切换为 UART3 TX 和 RX"
" 引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusf7.rst:66 7bb2548d8868470d89bc4da6eedfb624
msgid "Default UART order"
msgstr "默认 UART 顺序"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusf7.rst:68 c150309d56184be5a216dff27b190ead
msgid "SERIAL0 = console = USB"
msgstr "SERIAL0 = 控制台 = USB"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusf7.rst:69 db38d637e82c48dd82c8844e3d40073b
msgid "SERIAL1 = Telemetry1 = USART1"
msgstr "SERIAL1 = Telemetry1 = USART1"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusf7.rst:70 5b15970b6dfd4472b38fb1fdbf405491
msgid ""
"SERIAL2 = Telemetry2 = USART3 if :ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` = 2, "
"otherwise these pins are used for I2C pins (firmware 4.1 or later)"
msgstr ""
"SERIAL2 = Telemetry2 = USART3（若 :ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` = "
"2，否则这些引脚用于 I2C 引脚，固件 4.1 或更高版本）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusf7.rst:71 fe6a85a6893147e691e73bfe80875094
msgid "SERIAL3 = GPS1 = USART6"
msgstr "SERIAL3 = GPS1 = USART6"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusf7.rst:72 1224ff74142149219785c4e84018c81f
msgid ""
"SERIAL4 = GPS2 = USART2 (RX only if :ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` = "
"1, otherwise this pin is used for RC input labeled SBUS on board)"
msgstr ""
"SERIAL4 = GPS2 = USART2（若 :ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` = 1 则仅 "
"RX，否则此引脚用于板上标记为 SBUS 的 RC 输入）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusf7.rst:73 6e58705993114437820fc0d84f7ec558
msgid "SERIAL5 = USER = UART7 (RX only, in V2 only)"
msgstr "SERIAL5 = 用户 = UART7（仅 RX，仅限 V2 版本）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusf7.rst:74 2e0f12805ac74e4cba91aa2559476e44
msgid "SERIAL6 = not assigned"
msgstr "SERIAL6 = 未分配"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusf7.rst:76 dc98685cb13a4da4b14a8b2459a036e3
msgid "Serial protocols can be adjusted to personal preferences."
msgstr "串口协议可根据个人偏好调整。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusf7.rst:79 b3875292dd484fa780e079fe45300746
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusf7.rst:80 b635ff6745df44f5ade2ad4cfd28cb0a
msgid ""
"RC input is configured on the SBUS (UART2_RX) pin. It supports all RC "
"protocols, however for FPort  :ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` should "
"be set to 1 with SERIAL4_OPTIONS=15 as described in the :ref:`FPort<common-"
"FPort-receivers>` section."
msgstr ""
"RC 输入配置在 SBUS（UART2_RX）引脚上。它支持所有 RC 协议，但对于 FPort，应将 "
":ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` 设置为 1，并如 :ref:`FPort<common-FPort-"
"receivers>` 部分所述将 SERIAL4_OPTIONS=15。"

